NOTICE
======

musa-adapter derives from megatron-musa-patch (baseline revision a1090de).
Ported elements include:

  * attention capability windows (MuDNN v3107 forward/backward matrix,
    mate TileLang verified shapes) -- see
    src/musa_adapter/providers/attention/mudnn.py and mate.py;
  * the Megatron TEDotProductAttention binding (dense dispatch and packed
    THD slicing) -- see src/musa_adapter/patches/megatron/attention.py;
  * the Qwen3-VL RMSNorm contract -- see
    src/musa_adapter/patches/transformers/qwen3_vl_rms_norm.py and
    docs/MIGRATION_LEDGER.md for the full per-patch mapping.

